{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, move towards and grab if near, or else move closer and check properties, finally execute task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectNear    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectFar    /> <SubTree ID = ExecuteTask    />",
